OL,3,ATwo men arrested after boy injured in
OL,4,Asword attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 19-year-old, from Gloucester, was
OL,7,Farrested overnight on suspicion of
OL,8,Fassault occasioning actual bodily harm
OL,9,Fand affray. An 18-year-old, also from
OL,10,FGloucester, was held on suspicion of
OL,11,Fpossession of an offensive weapon,
OL,12,Fassault occasioning actual bodily harm
OL,13,Fand affray.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
