OL,3,AWith Stephen Miller pick, Trump readies
OL,4,Afor a battle
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The mission now is more clear than
OL,7,Fever: Fight with all of our soul to
OL,8,Fsupport our president and defend this
OL,9,Fmagnificent republic," Miller posted on
OL,10,FX, adding that he was "honored beyond
OL,11,Fwords" to be Trump's pick for the job.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
