OL,3,AParaguay's president impeached and
OL,4,Aunder house arrest after bank collapse
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe had offered to step down on
OL,7,FThursday. Rather than accept his
OL,8,Fresignation, senators impeached Pena
OL,9,Fand charged him with misconduct,
OL,10,Fmeaning he has been stripped of the
OL,11,Fimmunity usually granted to
OL,12,Fex-presidents.
OL,14,FPena, who until last year held shares
OL,15,Fin the company that owned the bank, has
OL,16,Fdenied any wrongdoing.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
